   {
    "ja-ro": "Life Trade ~Shufu to Kyaba Jou no Koukan Jinsei~"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A housewife and a cabaret girl. What happens when two people who never cross paths decide to switch places and lead different lives? Rei Yashiro is a housewife who is frightened of her morally harassing husband and despised by her rebellious daughter. Although she has an appearance that is the envy of all, Kyoko is a troublemaker whose aggressive personality continually causes trouble at the restaurant. The moment these two pass each other on the street, a thunderclap rumbles through the air. Waking up in a hospital bed, the two quickly realize that their respective personalities have been switched. Rei has a young and beautiful body. With their bodies switched, they are forced to lead different lives. Each with her own secrets."
  },
